Faction War mechanics
Weekly Faction War

Every week:

Faction contribution resets.
Factions compete on total valid contribution.
Top factions unlock next-week perks.

Scoring sources:

Accepted arcade runs
Faction daily missions
Faction seasonal missions
Roguelite rabbit holes
Streaks
Battle Chamber quests
Leaderboard clout
Special events

Weekly rewards:

#1 faction: major XP prize pool + best roguelite perk
#2 faction: medium XP prize pool + secondary perk
#3 faction: small XP prize pool + cosmetic/badge

Keep rewards as XP / clout / badges / cosmetics / roguelite options, not financial claims.

Monthly Clout War

Every month:

Faction clout is ranked across the whole website.

Monthly ranking should include:

faction power
daily mission completions
weekly placements
top-player scores
activity streaks
leaderboard appearances
quest completions

Monthly rewards:

Faction title upgrade
Faction profile border
Faction sticker pack
Faction banner
Bonus rabbit-hole path for next month
Monthly Hall of Fame placement
Seasonal Campaign

Every season:

A full campaign runs across all factions.

Seasonal campaign examples:

Season 1: The Clout War
Season 2: Battle for Neon Sprawl
Season 3: Hard Fork Uprising
Season 4: The Proof Wall Rebellion

Seasonal rewards:

Seasonal badge
Season title
Faction archive placement
Permanent clout record
Special roguelite modifier
Special faction page trophy
